00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:40.014
Grimace's ancestry dates back to Grimace Island, the homeland of the Grimace race.

00:03:40.062 --> 00:03:43.726
In the 2001 episode The Legend of Grimace Island, Grimace explains

00:03:43.758 --> 00:03:46.946
that it's the original home of all Grimaces, a great big island that's been

00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:49.894
lost for hundreds of years, meaning the island has been lost since at least

00:03:49.932 --> 00:03:50.930
the 1800s.

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.374
According to Grimace legend, no one in the entire world knows the current

00:03:54.412 --> 00:03:55.762
whereabouts of Grimace Island.

00:03:55.826 --> 00:03:59.158
The Grimaces lived in harmony, dressing up in tribal clothing and living in

00:03:59.164 --> 00:04:00.130
these giant hives.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.710
Imagine you're an explorer in the 1800s.

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:06.086
After sailing the seas by moonlight, you come across an island and seek shelter,

00:04:06.118 --> 00:04:09.174
and you notice these great big caves sitting on the hill.

00:04:09.222 --> 00:04:12.230
You go inside, but then you hear breathing.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:17.176
You start to see the whites of eyes blinking all around, and that's when you realize

00:04:17.176 --> 00:04:19.226
you're standing in a huddle of Grimaces.

00:04:19.338 --> 00:04:20.990
It's not such a far fetched story.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.934
One day, a tribe of humans appeared on the island in search of treasure and

00:04:23.972 --> 00:04:24.974
made off with much of it.

00:04:25.012 --> 00:04:28.142
But the most valuable of the treasure was hidden away underground

00:04:28.196 --> 00:04:29.738
to protect what they had the Gorons.

00:04:29.834 --> 00:04:33.006
I mean, the Grimaces performed a sacred dance, causing the island to break

00:04:33.028 --> 00:04:35.970
away from its moorings and float away into uncharted waters.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:38.886
This is probably a good time for me to emphasize just how massive these

00:04:38.908 --> 00:04:39.622
creatures are.

00:04:39.676 --> 00:04:43.078
At the time of The Legend of Grimace Island in 2001, Grimace is stated to be

00:04:43.084 --> 00:04:47.158
a crushing 900 pounds, or 408 kg, which I'm guessing is the weight of a

00:04:47.164 --> 00:04:48.130
fully grown Grimace.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:51.926
However, even as a 16 year old, Grimace's first driver's license states that

00:04:51.948 --> 00:04:56.506
he's 9ft, eight inches and 320 pounds, or 145 kilograms.

00:04:56.528 --> 00:04:59.846
Result is that a herd of Grimaces can produce an earthquake like blast.

00:04:59.958 --> 00:05:05.110
But what about our Grimace? Well, McDonald's has detailed some of his lineage in a press release, 

00:05:05.212 --> 00:05:06.606
because this is just the timeline that we live in.

00:05:06.628 --> 00:05:10.026
Grimace is from Grimace Island and comes from a huge family, including

00:05:10.058 --> 00:05:13.674
his grandma Winky, his aunts Millie, and Tilly, and his uncle O'Grimacey.

00:05:13.722 --> 00:05:16.818
However, for unknown reasons, Grimace was sent off on a pilgrimage from a

00:05:16.824 --> 00:05:21.010
very young age, and it wouldn't be long before he would be indoctrinated.

